@contentType = application/json

### Logga in som admin — KÖR DENNA FÖRST i denna fil
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userName": "{{adminUserName}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Skapa ny user (tekniker1)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "username": "{{techUserName}}",
  "password": "{{techPassword}}",
  "role": 0
}

### Verifiera att inloggning fungerar
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Negativtest — fel lösenord → 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userName": "{{adminUserName}}",
  "password": "fellosenord"
}

### Negativtest — saknar userName → 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}